WEBVTT

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:35.230
Wow! How beautiful!

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:49.830
Welcome to my domain.

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:59.470
Lord Yorunami, Shiotsuchi 
is old! Please forgive him!

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:01.380
Failure is a crime.

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:03.930
I ordered Shiotsuchi 
the Sho to take control

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:07.070
of all the salt supplies in this nation,

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:09.480
yet he did not even make a move into

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:11.190
the domains of the other Shinsho.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:13.270
But, if he had taken their salt,

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:14.940
the people would suffer 
just as the Sho...

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:17.260
I am well aware of that.

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:21.820
Are you saying you all won't 
mind if I don't become king?

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.250
Of course not...

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:36.150
If you are going to serve me, 
you must be flawless in your duties.

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:39.050
I have no need for flawed Zokusho.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:42.540
They are unnecessary.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:48.400
This path leads to Tamayori, 
where Yorunami is.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:49.980
Admiration

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.980
All right, let's go!

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:53.800
Arata?

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.150
I don't want to see Yorunami yet.

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:58.990
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:01.560
I don't want to defeat Yorunami.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:04.970
So, before I meet him face to face,

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:07.670
I want to know what he's like.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:12.040
That's why I want to meet 
Yorunami's Zokusho first.

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:15.210
I agree!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.680
Arata doesn't make others 
submit by fighting.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.720
He calms their desire to fight and

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.630
accepts the life force they give him.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:23.550
Kotoha...

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:27.200
Y-Yeah! I'm with Kotoha-chan!

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.600
Have you no pride?

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:34.630
Hm? Arata, your sleeve is fraying.

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.320
Oh, you're right.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.170
I just realized...

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:42.960
Kotoha-chan is all chummy 
when she talks to Arata now.

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:44.390
What happened?

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.040
They've crossed the line.

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:49.160
Line?! You mean...

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.740
Kannagi, what's the 
closest town to here?

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:02.760
This is the most prosperous 
city in Amawakuni, Suzukura.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.180
Wow...

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:08.260
Yorunami's Zokusho rules this city.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.310
I've never met him, but I 
believe his name is Hiruko.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.480
This is all you've got 
between the four of you?

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.180
It's nowhere near enough.

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:20.450
It's not right!

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:22.700
Why do we have to pay just 
to get into the city?!

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:26.620
There's a passage tax for both 
entering and leaving the city.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.620
That's the rule here in Suzukura.

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:32.460
If you want to enter the city, 
you'll work off what you owe.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:33.790
I don't like it!

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:37.500
Now, where shall we have you work?

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.300
Hey, old man!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.060
Hey.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.530
I'll take these guys.

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:46.310
Suehiro-san...

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.680
There's so much to see!

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:56.150
What do you think? 
This is the center of Suzukura.

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:58.940
You can find anything you desire here.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.580
Too flashy for my tastes.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:04.860
There you go, trying to 
sound cool again, Kanna—

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:08.340
Idiot. Don't call me by name.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:12.200
Why do you think I covered my 
mark of the Twelve Shinsho?

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.290
What beautiful hairpins!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.030
You can shop later.

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:24.500
You can buy all you want with 
the money you make working.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.910
Men work in the quarry, 
women in the textile workshops.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.890
We'll make sure you work hard.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:33.320
Aww, man, a quarry?

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.960
Man, this is killing my back!

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:49.870
You there!

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:52.740
What are you doing? No slacking off!

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:54.960
I'm just resting for a second!

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:58.510
Hey, you! What are you doing?!

00:05:58.510 --> 00:06:01.120
I was told to transport rocks, so I am.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.750
Those are too small!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.630
I received no directions about size.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.800
That little...

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:14.100
I'm never going to meet 
the Zokusho at this rate.

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:18.080
Suehiro-san, we're finished 
with our part here.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:20.130
Quick work as always, Chief.

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.610
Your reputation with Master 
Hiruko is soaring, too.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:26.520
Maybe that Suehiro guy is the 
shortest path to the Zokusho.

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:28.820
Quit your slacking!

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.240
Even such a little kid...

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:38.350
Can't even do decent work...

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.710
You little wage stealer.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.780
Arata... Taking a break?

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:57.260
Uh, yeah.

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:09.560
How's your work going? It must be hard.

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:11.120
Yeah, kind of...

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:15.990
I'm still not used to 
talking to you this way.

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:20.340
You're Hinohara Arata.

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:23.330
Not the Master Arata I know.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.530
Even though you look exactly the same...

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:31.340
I, um...

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:40.100
Sorry, it's nothing.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.360
Haniyasu?

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:46.760
Hinohara is there?

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:50.530
Well, first, there's someone 
I want you to meet.

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:55.660
A man who has experienced something similar 
to what happened between you and Hinohara.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:05.380
In order to conquer the barbarians,

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:09.040
the Kamui of the Twelve Shinsho 
under the control of the princess

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.550
were temporarily unleashed.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.480
These are the records of that time.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:19.420
This is one of the Twelve Shinsho.

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:22.210
Akachi.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:25.660
Akachi...

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.070
What is Lord Yorunami like?

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:32.900
How should I know? 
He's one of the Twelve Shinsho.

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:36.860
Forget that, bro. 
I've got some nice stuff here.

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:39.220
Oh, I don't have the money for...

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:44.530
Oh, you've got a good eye, I see.

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:46.000
What's this?

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:49.420
Already going shopping 
with today's pay?

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:51.370
Suehiro-san...

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:58.030
Was it for that girl 
you brought with you?

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.860
You're quite the nice guy.

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:02.430
Don't blame me if it gets you tricked.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:04.520
That wouldn't...

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:07.610
Um, Suehiro-san...

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.110
Have you ever met Lord Yorunami?

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.610
What's this all of a sudden?

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:15.600
I mean, I heard he was an amazing man.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:17.800
I was just wondering what 
was amazing about him.

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:23.850
He is noble and benevolent, 
and he sees all things.

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:29.100
And right now, he seeks perfection 
in everyone, including himself.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:31.680
That's what he's like.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:33.460
Right now?

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:40.700
It was Lord Yorunami who came 
up with Suzukura's laws.

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:45.430
Thanks to him, it has grown into the 
most prosperous city in Amawakuni.

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:50.940
Well, shall we head back? 
It gets cold at night.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.230
A perfect city?

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:05.910
What are you doing?!

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:10.580
What are you gonna do about this?!

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:12.840
Hey! Are you okay?

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:17.260
What's going on here? What did he do?

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:20.180
He broke a valuable wagon!

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:21.550
It wasn't me!

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.010
No excuses!

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:26.270
Man, we can't use this anymore.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:28.260
You said it.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:32.050
You're fired.

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:33.430
Please, wait!

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:35.460
I don't need useless kids here!

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:37.400
It hurts my reputation!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:39.860
Wait! He says he didn't do it!

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.780
This has nothing to do 
with you! Stay out of it!

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.820
I understand.

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:47.040
Then, if I could have 
my pay up to now...

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:50.420
That's gone. We'll be 
using it for repairs.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.250
But...

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:55.880
You bastard!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:56.760
That's enough.

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:00.310
Suehiro-san...

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.820
Have you forgotten, Chief?

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:06.490
Fighting is forbidden.

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:09.940
Sorry, sir. Please don't tell 
Master Hiruko about this.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.810
I'll let it slide this time.

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:16.480
Next time you disrupt the public 
order, you're on your way to jail.

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:17.470
Yes, sir!

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.990
It's kind of...

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:22.840
...shabby, huh?

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.240
I'm sorry.

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:28.710
So there's a place like this just 
behind this city's lively facade.

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:32.170
Everyone comes to Suzukura 
hoping to get rich quick.

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:35.630
But the reality isn't that simple.

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:39.300
Ruka, where are your parents?

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.740
They died last year.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:46.020
They were wholesale textile 
dealers on the main street,

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:47.510
until they got sick.

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:51.130
Then everyone working in the shop quit.

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:54.980
We went bankrupt, and shortly 
after that, my mother...

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.080
That's cruel of them.

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:59.690
They owed your dad a lot, didn't they?

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:02.200
That's how this world works.

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:06.450
Damn! Is money all people think about?

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:10.540
That guy from before, too. 
All he cared about was his reputation!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:15.710
The chief was the head 
clerk at our shop.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.760
Him?! That bastard!

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:21.470
How...

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:25.490
How is this a perfect city?

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:30.080
This city is nowhere near perfect!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:34.210
Ruka, why don't you 
just leave this place?

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:35.220
But...

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:37.020
If you're worried about 
money, I'll pay for you!

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:40.490
The passage tax is ten silver.

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:42.070
I don't have that much money.

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:44.740
That's a ripoff!

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:48.410
So knock others down 
until you reach the top.

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:52.200
That's what Suzukura is all about.

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:56.510
Who do you think you are?

00:12:56.510 --> 00:13:00.170
I'm just a stingy control 
freak, Lord Kannagi.

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:06.830
More importantly, what do 
you think of Arata the Sho?

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:09.430
Master Hiruko is interested in him.

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:11.630
What do I think?

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:13.960
Oh, I was just wondering why

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:17.100
a man of your status
 is traveling with him.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:20.400
Just because. No particular reason.

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:22.600
You want to become king, too, don't you?

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:26.700
Is it his Hayagami you're after?

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:29.800
You said your name's Suehiro?

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:31.710
Trying to provoke me won't work.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:35.500
You seem to be having a 
good time toying with us,

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:36.620
but don't take us lightly.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:40.380
Especially Arata. He is formidable.

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:46.550
Hang in there. It's almost ready.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:48.640
Thank you, Kanate-san.

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:51.400
You'll feel better once you drink this!

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.990
<i>Y-You wanted to talk?</i>

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:07.000
<i>Drink up first.</i>

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.270
<i>I made the consommé soup you love.</i>

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.510
<i>I've decided.</i>

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:20.250
<i>Arata, you should do 
what you want to do.</i>

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:26.500
<i>I'll wait as long as it takes until 
you can act on your own will.</i>

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:30.260
<i>I believe in you.</i>

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:38.010
<i>No matter what may happen,</i>

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:41.660
<i>I'm on your side.</i>

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:06.460
It's good!

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.470
It is good.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.050
You see? Have all the refills you'd like!

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:17.560
Thank you, Kanate-san.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.190
Wh-Why are you crying?

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:24.310
I wanted to just disappear.

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.190
How can you say something so stupid?!

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:31.860
Because I was alone, 
and it was so hard...

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:33.550
I understand.

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:36.430
I was the same.

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:38.860
When bad things keep happening,

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:39.990
you just want to run away.

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:43.420
I wondered why it all happened to me, 
when I'd done nothing wrong.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:46.770
But if I had thrown 
everything away then,

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:49.530
I'd never know why I had been born.

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:55.090
Since you were born into this world, 
you can't just end your life.

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:59.980
There's no one the world 
would be better off without.

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:06.150
I want to leave this city.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:07.610
All right.

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:11.750
Kanate and I will get you out of here.

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:13.090
Leave it to us!

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:15.310
But if you do that...

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:17.120
You're a nice kid.

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:20.680
Go on living, and never 
forget those feelings.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.730
Okay! We leave when the city is quiet!

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:29.440
We'll help, too.

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:30.590
Kotoha-chan!

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:31.830
Even you, Kannagi?

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:33.860
She brought me here. That's all.

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:37.260
It was Lord Kannagi who 
told me what was going on.

00:16:42.570 --> 00:16:44.840
Your wounds have closed up completely!

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.290
I'm so glad!

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:48.480
How...

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:52.880
...can you smile for me?

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:55.120
How?

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:56.950
Because I'm happy, too!

00:16:57.650 --> 00:16:58.910
Is that strange?

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:04.070
The power chamber is damaged!

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:05.500
Temporarily disconnecting!

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:07.500
Wait! Bring the ship closer!

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:09.460
Leave.

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:12.170
I have no business with the Six Sho.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.700
Akachi...

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:22.300
Appear, Orochi!

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:36.030
You're not one of the Six Sho.

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:40.300
Akachi, I saw your battle.

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:42.180
You're incredible!

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:44.960
Hey, wanna team up with me?

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:46.550
What did you say?

00:17:46.550 --> 00:17:52.130
Your nemesis, Kannagi, is with 
my nemesis, Hinohara Arata.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:54.210
Working together would benefit us both.

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:59.180
Why should I team up 
with a rug rat like you?

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:03.610
Anyone who lacks the 
resolve to fight alone

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:04.890
will only slow me down.

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:08.110
Go home.

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:09.370
Wait!

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:10.270
Hold it!

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:16.550
I just want to beat him!

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:20.190
If I don't, there was no 
point in me coming here!

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:23.360
I don't want to think he's ahead of me

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:26.370
by a single second, 
or a single millimeter!

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.280
I want to win!

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.090
I want to beat him!

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:35.920
I see. However...

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:41.390
You cannot defeat Arata.

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:45.100
Let me tell you why.

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:47.200
Because you are trapped.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:49.970
You are trapped

00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:53.250
by the phantom of the bond 
reflected in your eyes.

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:55.110
That's why you can't win.

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:59.700
I will set you free.

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:13.890
Let's go!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.160
Suehiro!

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.310
Let us go! Please!

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.950
Suehiro is only an alias.

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:31.910
My real name is...

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:37.440
Lord Yorunami's number 
one Zokusho, Hiruko.

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:40.820
Suehiro-san is Master Hiruko?!

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:43.020
So that's it.

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:51.460
This city is not perfect.

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:56.810
It does not see people as people.

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:58.170
This city is heartless!

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:02.330
Heartless, eh?

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:06.310
<i>Why did you attack me?</i>

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:09.820
<i>I made a fortune, 
and people flocked to me.</i>

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:13.200
<i>But all they want is the money.</i>

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:15.770
<i>I'm not even needed.</i>

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:20.440
<i>Come on! Destroy me with your Kamui!</i>

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:29.870
<i>Hiruko the Sho...</i>

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:32.750
<i>Become my Zokusho.</i>

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:39.990
<i>Where exists a human who is not needed?</i>

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:47.600
Appear, Takara!

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:49.500
Appear!

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:55.560
Money?! That's his Kamui?!

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.160
Maybe it's you.

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:13.280
I've been watching you.

00:21:13.820 --> 00:21:16.030
Lord Yorunami's orders, you know.

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:19.590
I've seen you suffering, fighting,

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:22.260
and turning into a demon.

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:25.660
That's why I wanted to find out

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:29.260
whether you're really the 
right man for the job.

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:35.440
Ruka.

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:38.620
There's no need for you to leave.

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:41.770
I will change this city.

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:44.790
No more pretending it's perfect.

00:21:46.900 --> 00:21:49.160
I will defy Lord Yorunami.

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:52.620
He's...

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:57.540
Arata, bring back the 
Lord Yorunami I know.

00:21:58.030 --> 00:22:03.290
I believe you can return him 
to the way he once was.

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:08.530
I've seen quite enough...

00:23:40.950 --> 00:23:44.300
The Hayagami Tsukuyo, 
the origin of all things.

00:23:44.300 --> 00:23:47.800
Once I obtain it, the throne 
is as good as mine.

00:23:47.800 --> 00:23:51.640
This time, I know my 
mother will be pleased.

00:23:51.010 --> 00:25:00.000
Life Force

00:23:51.640 --> 00:23:54.050
Appear, Nakisawa!
